{"id":"vod_lz_86573","vodId":"86573","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"魔法骑士","name_cn":"魔法骑士","date":"1994-01-01","year":"1994","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20240410-1/9ce6dcce2b44004b90125cd3be4ca779.jpg"},"summary":"长相可爱个性爽朗的狮堂光（椎名碧流 配音）、心思细腻温柔高贵的大小姐龙崎海（吉田古奈美 配音）、智勇双全成熟稳重的凤凰寺风（笠原弘子 配音），命运让这三名个性迥异的女孩相遇了，她们被选中成为了魔法骑士，前往濒临崩溃的锡菲罗，拯救那里的居民于水火之中。　　支撑着锡菲罗的支柱是名叫艾美诺（绪方惠美 配音）的公主，她为了这个城市而生，为了这个城市而活，通过虔诚的祈祷，艾美诺保佑着锡菲罗。然而，艾美诺却爱上了她的神官谢加图（小杉十郎太 配音），因此而无法集中精神祈祷，锡菲罗因此而遇到了前所未有的危机，解决危机的方法只有一个，那就是杀掉艾美诺。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-10 13:08:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":48,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2571_c60efce2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2574_55e2112e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2575_8de3886e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2577_d83d8ea9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2578_cf252cc1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2576_29006862/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2579_ee9635f9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2583_e7cb0b23/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2580_83e5e955/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2581_db41b43f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2584_94cf35ad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2582_386dc19c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2586_9c5de2e6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2592_9495652c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz20.com/20240407/2585_5df2b91f/index.m3u8"},{"nam